h answer shows the right one and why; press <b class="gd-ui">Try again</b> as often as you need.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">A section that is on two of your paths (the policies, for example) counts on both once passed.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>An Admin can open a section early for you, for example when you already did this work somewhere else. The academy gate is on: each section opens once you pass the one before it, and the rest of the portal waits until you pass your paths (the guide and your profile stay open). Each path ends with a section on what changed recently.</div></aside></section>');
